      "text": "ram caught … by his horns, Gen. 22:13. make the horns of it upon the four corners, Ex. 27:2. upon the horns of the altar, Ex. 29:12 (Lev. 4:7; 8:15). before the ark seven trumpets of rams’ horns, Josh. 6:4. mine horn is exalted in the Lord, 1 Sam. 2:1. horn of my salvation, 2 Sam. 22:3 (Ps. 18:2). caught hold on the horns of the altar, 1 Kgs. 1:50. will I make the horn of David to bud, Ps. 132:17. horn of the house of Israel to bud forth, Ezek. 29:21. fourth beast … had ten horns, Dan. 7:7 (7:20). considered the horns, and … another little horn, Dan. 7:8. ten horns … are ten kings, Dan. 7:24 (Rev. 17:12). ram which had two horns: and the two horns were high, Dan. 8:3. out of one of them came forth a little horn, Dan. 8:9. will make thine horn iron, Micah 4:13 (3 Ne. 20:19). saw, and behold four horns, Zech. 1:18.",
